WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.400
You have this.

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:02.600
Now what?

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:06.000
One photo. Ten ingredients.

00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:10.000
Dinner from what’s actually in there.

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:13.500
The two things you’re missing, on a list.

00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:17.400
Which shop has them. And for how much. Both, at Iceland, for £2.25.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:20.500
FeedMe AI. One photo. Dinner sorted, down to the till.
